{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"Wahou ! (Wow!)","Catherine (Karin Viard) et Oracio (Bruno Podalydès) sont conseillers immobiliers et enchaînent les visites de deux biens: une grande maison bourgeoise « piscinable, vue RER », et un petit appartement moderne situé en plein triangle d'or de Bougival. Malgré des visites agitées, ils ne perdent pas de vue leur objectif : provoquer le coup de cœur chez les potentiels acheteurs, le vrai, l’unique qui leur fera oublier tous les défauts. Celui qui leur fera dire « Wahou ! » (For sale: a beautiful 19th century house and a small modern flat, both in Bougival. Two estate agents from the Wow agency, along with their assistant, do what they can to display the properties to their best advantage. But their showings are troubled, revealing the domestic, professional and emotional problems of the potential buyers.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"high rank employment","urban","mentorship","independent home","retirement","marriage","fatherhood","motherhood","disability",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":20,"filmType":24,"directors":25,"genre":34,"media":36,"synopsis":39,"production":42,"characters":45,"roles":66,"awards":150,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_123","fr2023-123-wahou",{"native":18,"english":19},"Wahou !","Wow!",{"type":21,"date":22,"year":23},"Theatrical release","2023-06-07",2023,"Fiction film",[26],{"id":27,"slug":28,"name":27,"birthYear":29,"deathYear":30,"gender":31,"nationality":32,"awards":33},"Bruno Podalydès","bruno-podalydes",1961,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[35],"Comedy",{"posterUrl":37,"trailerUrl":38},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/214/10/264918/format_page/wahou.png","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r0eJlKFS120",{"native":40,"english":41},"Catherine (Karin Viard) et Oracio (Bruno Podalydès) sont conseillers immobiliers et enchaînent les visites de deux biens: une grande maison bourgeoise « piscinable, vue RER », et un petit appartemen